		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0501_middleman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>プラズマだんに　ポケモンを　うばわれ
いまだに　はなればなれ……▽
そんな　ひとも　いるそうですよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T07:56:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>プラズマ団に　ポケモンを　奪われ
いまだに　離ればなれ……▽
そんな　人も　いるそうですよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T07:57:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クリア前
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T07:56:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEWOMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0501_middleman2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンを　うばわれた　ひとですけど
もとプラズマだんが　かえしにきたって▼
ですけど　それで　いいのですかね？
あたしは　なっとく　できないわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T08:03:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T07:57:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンを　奪われた　人ですけど
元プラズマ団が　返しにきたって▼
ですけど　それで　いいのですかね？
あたしは　納得できないわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T08:03:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T07:59:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クリア後
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T07:56:41" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEWOMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T07:56:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
